hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1755","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maut ko chitkabre mendhey ki soorat mein laaya jaaeyga. To pukaarne wala pukaarega: Ae Jannat walon! To wo gardan uthaayengey aur dekhengey. To wo kahega: Kya tum isey pehchaantey ho? To wo kahengey: Haan, ye maut hai. Jabke wo sab use dekh chukey hain. Phir pukaarega: Ae aag walon! To wo gardan uthaayengey aur dekhengey. To wo kahega: Kya tum isey pehchaantey ho? To wo kahengey: Haan, ye maut hai. Jabke wo sab use dekh chukey hain. To wo zibah kya jaaeyga. Phir wo kahega: Ae Jannat walon! Hamesha, maut nahi hai. Aur ae aag walon! Hamesha, maut nahi hai. Phir Aap ne padha: (Aur unhey hasrat key din se daraao jab muamla poora kya gaya jabke wo ghaflat mein hain). Aur ye duniya walon ki ghaflat mein hain (aur wo imaan nahi laatey). (Bukhari: 4730). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur jo apni biwiyon par tohmat lagaatey hain jabke unkey paas apne siwa gawaah nahi hain)."
